@startuml 04-sequence-refund-failed-payment
title PayLink - Refund a Failed Payment
autonumber

actor Customer
participant PaymentService
participant Wallet
participant Biller

PaymentService -> Biller : pay()
Biller --> PaymentService : refused
PaymentService -> Wallet : release(total)
Wallet --> PaymentService : balance restored
PaymentService --> Customer : REFUNDED + SMS/push
@enduml
